━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ TimelineSecondsScale
    is TimelineScale

+ units-per-second I64

────────────────────
+ This
    - units-per-second

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is TimelineScale ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do marks [TimelineMark]
    - span I64
    - width Length

. result [TimelineMark]
=? result if width <= 0 || span <= 0
. rate = units-per-second as F64
. seconds = (span as F64) / rate
. step = timeline-seconds-step(seconds * 64 / (width as F64))
. tenths = round(step * 10) as I64
. count = (seconds / step) as Index
for index in 0 .. count
    . point = tenths * (index as I64)
    result += TimelineMark(round((point as F64) * rate / 10) as I64, timeline-tenths-label(point))
= result

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ do timeline-seconds-step F64
    - minimum F64

for step in [0.1, 0.2, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 5.0, 10.0, 15.0, 30.0, 60.0, 120.0, 300.0, 600.0]
    =? step if step >= minimum
= 600.0

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ timeline-tenths-label String
    - tenths I64

if tenths % 10 == 0 then "${tenths / 10}s" else "${tenths / 10}.${tenths % 10}s"

